<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="HAB" style="id">Habakkuk</book>
  <para style="h">Habakkuk</para>
  <para style="toc1">Habakkuk</para>
  <para style="toc2">Habakkuk</para>
  <para style="mt">Habakkuk</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hi thu sia Topa in kamsaangpa Habakkuk tungah a pualaak thu ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Topa awng, ngongtatna pan nong ngup natu, nong zaak ma in bang tanvei hu ngenin, kong biakpui kul tu ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuabang ngimnate banghangin hong musak ni ziam? Tuabang tatkhialnate en in bangbangin thuak zo ni ziam? Siatna le ngongtatnate ka kiimkot ah om a, kihauna le kidona mun theampo ah om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Upadi in thu nei zo ngawlin a luithawthong suak a, thutangin thu a kikhen bua hi. Thutang khenna thute kileekai in misia te in thutang mite zo zawsap hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuasia ciang Topa in a mite tungah, “Na kiim na paam a minamte encik vun, tua hile na mu uh thu hangin lamdang na sa tu uh hi. Tuasia na zaak ciang zong na up ngawl natu in bang khat po kong vawt tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua a kiitakhuai a om thong thei ngawl Babylon te tungah vaangletna ka pia tu hi. Amate in ngamdangte a zawthal natu in leitung theampo ah kuan tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Amate in kiitakna le patauna kizelsak a, amate ii kiphasakna taw amate ma in upadi khat suaksakin a dei bang thukhen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“A siphute pawlbeam sangin manlang zaw a, ngia ngilkialte sangin kiitakhuai zaw hi. A siphu ngalkapte ngam khuala pan hong pai a; a siphute in lei khuat uh hi. Muvanlaite suktun in a mat tute a zap bangin amate hong pai uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“A ngalkaphonpite ngongtat a, zawna taw hong kuanin, amate hong nai ciang a kuama po patau hi. A ngal matte, senvui za in tam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Amate in kumpipate zawnsak vawt a, zanei uliante nuisan zazaan lel uh hi. Amate a khaktan zo tu kulh om peuma ngawl a — amate in tua kulh sia lei sunnel in la hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tua zawkciang a thahatna sia amate ii pathian ahi, hi mite, sia vuiva bangin paisuak a bo uh hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Topa awng, a kipatciil a kipan nangma in Pathian na hi hi. Nangma in ka Pathian na hi a, thiangtho in, a tawntungin na om hi. Topa ka Pathian le hong dal pa awng, nangma in Babylon te na teal zo a, ko daan hong piak thei natu in na hatsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ahizong banghangin hi a thumaan ngawl misiate koithong thei ni ziam? Na mittangte siatna et natu in thiangtho leih a, khialna a vawt mite na mu thei bua hi. Tua ahikom amate sangin a thutangzawte a suksiat ciangin banghangin thim om thei ni ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Bangbangin tua mite sia lamlak tu ukpa nei ngawl ngasa le lungno honkhat bangin vawt thei ni ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Babylon te in ngasa tangthaak bang keakin mite man uh hi. Amate in tua ngeente taw kaikeak in a mat hu in lungdam in au ngawp lai hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Amate in a ngeente ngawngawn bia in tuate atu sangaw biakpiakna vawt hi, banghang ziam cile na theampo sung pan a pha belte tua ngeente in ngasak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Amate in a tawntungin namsau zangh a, hesuakna nei ngawlin minamte susia tawntung tu ziam?
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ka ngalvilna tausaang tungah ka kaa tu a, ka lungkim ngawl nate taw kisai Topa ii hong zo kikna le ka pau natu in hong son tu thute ngakin ka en tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Topa in hi bangin hong zo hi: “Et po ciang a kisim thei tu in kong pualaak thu sia suangpheak tungah thiang takin at in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Lai taw at in, banghang ziam cile tuasia a taangtut tu hun theng ngawl lai hi. Ahihang hun sia a manlangin hong theng tu a, kong lak sia taangtung tu hi. Hong pian tu haisaang thei tha tu hi, ahizong tuasia ngak in; hong piang tatak tu a, hong haisaang ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hi sia in a thupuak ahi hi: ‘A tatsia mite nungta ngawl tu a, ahizong thutang mite in Pathian tungah thumaan ahikom nungta tu uh hi,’ ” hong ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hauna in hong theam thei hi. A duhop a huaiham mihingte kiphasakin thim om thei ngawl hi — thina mama taw kibangin amate lungkim hun nei ngawl hi. Tua hu in amate in ngam khat zawkciang ngam khat amate atu in suanthal hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ngallelte in ngalzote thato tu a, huasaakna lak tu hi. Amate in, “Noma neisa ahi ngawlte laaksak nu hi, ahihang a lal na hi uh hi! Note tungah leei hong bate zawthawk thu in na siikna taw bang tanvei na hau tan lai tu uh ziam?” ci tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ahizong tuasia na heak ma in, noma ngual zothalte mama in leiba na nei tu uh a, a meet taw na piak tu in zawthawk thu taw leiba hong kinot tu hi. Ngalte hong pai in hong liingsak tu hi. Na vanhte hong suttol tu uh hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ngam tam mama ah mihingte na suttol uh hi, ahizong tu in a nungta laite in no hong suttol tu hi, banghang ziam cile noma in mihing na that uh a, leitung mite tung le a khuapite tungah na ngongtatna hang ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Na lal zo hi! Ngongtatna taw na laak te taw na innkuan na hausak a, siatna le launa pan na inn ngam muang tu in na hanciam hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ahihang na tup na sawmnate in na bangkua maizumsak hi; minam tam ma na suksiatna taw nangma tungah lalna bek na piangsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Luphung suangte ngawngawn in hong langpanin au a, zawlsaute zongh in tua aw thangko ma hong hawl kik hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Na lal zo hi! Khuapi khat sia kithalupna le khialna lian doppha in na saat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Na zawthal minamte in a tha a ngal uh a thawthong in bosak a, amate saksate theampo kaanghtum siat hi. Hi sia Topa Vaanglianbelpa ii vawt hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ahihang tuipi sia tui taw a kidim bangin leitung in Topa vaangletna heakna taw kidim tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Na lal zo hi! Na thinso hu in na innpaamte zawngsak in maizum pia ni hi; zukham bang keakin amate na hoisak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Nangma zongh min phatna sangin maizumna taw na kituam zaw tu hi. Nangma zongh zu ne in na hoi vatut tu hi. Topa in daan piakna hai hong dawnsak tu a, na minphatna sia min siatna hong suak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Lebanon taamthing na phuktham zo a; tu in nang hong kiphuk vawk tu hi. A ngamsate na that a, tu in tua ngamsate in hong lausak tu hi. Leitung le a khuapite tungah na ngongtatnate hang le tual na tha uh hang in tuabang in piang tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Milim ii kimanna bang ziam? Mihing ii vawt sa na khat hi bek a, leilot thu ngawl po bangma hong son ngawl hi. Tua a pau thei ngawl pathian — tua sia a vawtpa ii a muan sia bang phattuam pui tu ziam!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Nang a lal na hi zo hi! Thingbek khat tungah “Khanglo in!” tua ahibuale suangtum khat tungah “Tho in!” ci ni hi. Milim in na khat pawpo hong lak thei ziam? Khamh le ngunn taw kituam tha tu hi, ahizong a sungah nuntakna om ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Topa in a Biakinnpi thiangtho sungah om hi; ama mai ah leitung mihing theampo in thim dide in om tahen.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hisia in kamsaangpa Habakkuk thungetna ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Topa awng, na sep na vawtte ka za zo a, zakta in lamdang ka sa mama hi. Tu in ko hun sung zongh ah nasep lianpi na sep ngeite hong seam kik ta'n. Na thin uuk ciang zong hesuakna hong nei ta'n.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Edom panin Pathian hong pai kik tu hi; Paran mualte pan a thiangtho Pathian hong pai tu hi. A hoina in vantungte siin a; leitung in ama pokna taw kidim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ama khualeng taanna taw hong pai tu a; a khut pan khuavak tee keak a, tualai ah a vaangletna kiseal hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ama in natnate a mai ah puak a, thina ii a zui tu in thupia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ama a tawlngak ciang, leitung kithing a; Ama ii a et ciang minamte liinglawng hi. A tawntungin a om mualte kektham a; taanghlai hunin, a va ngeina mualte, a kip tawntung mualte kiasuk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Cushan mite launa ka mu a, Median mite liinglawng uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Topa awng, ngunte in hong thin uuksak ziam? Nang hong thinsosak sia tuipi ahi ziam? Meeite tungah na to hi; na mite zawna na puak ciang vuipi suangval meeikaai sia na leang ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Na thal zangh tu in na kinging zo hi, thaltangte kap tu in na kithoai hi. Na khualeng in simlei khentham hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mualte in nang hong mu ciangin liing uh a, van panin tui hong buasuk hi. Leinuai a tuite hawk vabuat a, a tuihualte khangin saangto hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A manlang na thaltangte a teet vazal ciang le na teitee te a taan ciang ni le tha te a omna ah tawlnga hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Thin uuk sa in leitung na kaantan a; thinsona taw minamte na tuanhcil hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Na mite le na teal kumpipa hun tu in na kuan hi. Mi ngilote lampui pa na vaatvawk a, a nungzuite na lalcipsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A zawngkhalte a zawthawk uh ciang a oaiaam mite bangin kote hong thethaang tu in a ngalkapte vuipi bangin hong pai ciang na thaltangte in a ngalkaphonpi ukpa kaaplet hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Na siphute taw tuipi na tuanhcil a, tuaciang a thahat tuite phuan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hite theampo ka za a, lau in ka liing hi; ka muk zongh liing hi. Ka pumpi zaw vaneal hi, ka nuai ah ka peang sui tha in ka liik hi. Keima in ko hong simte Pathian ii daan piak hun hong tun tu thim dide in ka ngak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Theikungte nga ngawl a, sapitkungte a nga bua zong, olive kungte nga ngawl a, lote sungah an a piang bua zong, tuute thi siat a, khuibukte a hawm zong,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />ka lungdamin ka thinnuam veve lai tu hi. Banghang ziam cile Topa Pathian in ka ngumpa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Vaanglianpipa Topa in thahatna hong pia hi. Ama in sangai bangin ka peang hong khosak a, mualte tungah hong keamcing hi.
  </para>
</usx>
